LadrunoSANISAND nDMaterial - Ladruno subclass of ManzariDafalias (model: A.Ghofrani, P.Arduino, U.Washington); settable p_residual/p_min. ADR 86.
LadrunoSANISAND tag 1: p_residual = 0 (default, cohesionless), p_min = 0.101 (user), honorTolR = 0 (ModifiedEuler substep TolE = 0.0001, vanilla's hardcoded value), TanType = 2 (consistent mCep_Consistent (unsymmetric)), maxSubsteps = 20000 (ModifiedEuler FAILS the update past this many substeps, so the step can be cut) [D5b: D_factor sigmoid non-dimensionalised in vanilla (PR-2), an exact no-op at P_atm = 101; D5a: whether it should exist at all once the residual pressure is zero is still OPEN]
LadrunoSANISAND tag 1: IMPL-EX ON. companion IntScheme 1 (ModifiedEuler, capped at 20000 substeps), alpha = 1, dt = pseudo (ops_Dt), -implexControl tol = 0.1 reductionLimit = 0.01 (refuses with LADRUNO_MATERIAL_REFUSED = -33086, which only an element that PROPAGATES it can act on -- today LadrunoBrick). TanType 2 is INERT under -implex: the delivered tangent is Ce(p_n), which is symmetric -- the non-associated consistent tangent disappears.
LadrunoSANISAND tag 1: READING HAZARD (ADR 92 section 8) -- every equilibrium on this material is an equilibrium of the EXTRAPOLATED stress. Any limit point read off an -implex leg must be confirmed on the implicit material, and implexError must be printed beside the verdict.
